# Path budget: this file <= 1024 bytes; exclusions only for dependencies,
# generated caches/reports at any nesting level, and disposable test scratch.
# The production dist/ export is deliberately included.
**/node_modules/
**/.npm/
**/.cache/
**/.vite/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
test/scratch/
# Deliver only these bounded validation artifacts.
!artifacts/
artifacts/*
!artifacts/validation.md
!artifacts/browser-results.json
!artifacts/taste.json
!artifacts/axe-ready.json
!artifacts/design-guidance-LICENSE.txt
!artifacts/390-first-screen.png
!artifacts/1440-playing.png
!artifacts/390-webkit.png
!artifacts/390-wake.png
